  <item>
    <title>一款预制菜的更名，竟然是性别意识进步的结果｜品牌月历</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66387b7203bcdd73a9bf26ec</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66387b7203bcdd73a9bf26ec</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 06 May 2024 13:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>你喜欢预制菜吗？日本全家便利店有一款名为「妈妈食堂」的预制菜很受欢迎。</span></p><span></span><p><span>不过它的名字却在近几年备受争议，最终在2021年正式改名为「Famimar」。</span></p><span></span><p><span>虽然官方并没有正式说明改名的原因，但该品牌几年前曾经因为固化了刻板性别角色而被Z世代抵制。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fh7N5KAn3OHm_G01pTWmK6tclxae.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>换掉畅销品的名字、换掉深入人心的国民代言人形象，并不是一夜之间的事情，而是近十几年日本性别观念的进步带来的改变。</span></p><span></span><p><span>那么，为什么今天我们不再需要「妈妈食堂」了？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="64">01:04</a> &nbsp;做预制菜的「男妈妈」</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="268">04:28</a> 从厨房到电视的日本女性主义启蒙</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="542">09:02</a> 觉醒的女性和过时的「妈妈食堂」</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.topys.cn/article/34226" data-url="https://www.topys.cn/article/34226"><span>💡 如果你想阅读本期节目的图文版，欢迎点击此处，即可跳转阅读推文</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>🎙️</span></p><span></span><p><span>｜About this episode｜</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期主播：鲸鱼</span></p><span></span><p><span>制作：鲸鱼</span></p><span></span><p><span>视觉设计：鱼饼</span></p><span></span><p><span>音乐：박상우 - 서른 되면 괜찮아져요</span></p><span></span><p><span>｜About us｜</span></p><span></span><p><span>TOPYS编辑部，暂时将你的mind close起来</span></p><span></span><p><span>微信公众号：顶尖文案TOPYS</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lt5lB3w7Y2VGLFh6n1bnUJJEDkN3.m4a" length="17008935" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:17:31</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlLaxD4h_basNSPXnzelJKvWHbWx.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>城南唠嗑 Vol.18 库索：离岛有一种无法用成功来定义的生活</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/662a1401015b97ee4669bd07</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">662a1401015b97ee4669bd07</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 25 Apr 2024 08:27:43 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>你知道吗？日本除了主岛，主岛周围还漂浮着大大小小的岛屿，它们被称为“离岛”。每200个日本人中就有1个生活在离岛。</span></p><span></span><p><span>那里的人们过着什么样的生活？有什么不为人知的风景和艰辛？离岛是城市人的躺平、避世之所吗？外来的移住者如何在偏僻之地重建自己的生活？</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期城南唠嗑请到了青年作家库索来聊聊她的新书《离岛》，她一一打破了大众对离岛这一避世之所的浪漫滤镜，离岛真实的面貌和迷人的风土人情渐渐显现，还看见了一种无法用成功来定义的生活。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fu3czCCBhBHrNge4ALVrJFKKLlX-.png"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="128">02:08</a> 何谓“离岛”？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="260">04:20</a> 离岛之旅、书写离岛的契机和转变</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="861">14:21</a> 从随笔到社会观察，始终在写人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1274">21:14</a> 移住离岛，打破浪漫的想象</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1649">27:29</a> 不再信任城市的父母在离岛育儿</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1995">33:15</a> 在离岛看见世俗成功标准以外的生活</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2453">40:53</a> 离岛上的年轻人为何来？又为何去？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2873">47:53</a>离岛移住者不等于数字游民</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3438">57:18</a> 每个人都适合离岛生活吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3943">65:43</a> 独立女性主动走向离岛</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4321">72:01</a> 创作是创作者的离岛</span></p><span></span><p><span>🔗节目文字内容：</span><a href="https://www.topys.cn/article/34241" data-url="https://www.topys.cn/article/34241"><span>www.topys.cn</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>📖《离岛》：</span><a href="https://shop18748095.m.youzan.com/wscgoods/detail/271j7jd1k5bifrs?scan=1&amp;activity=none&amp;from=kdt&amp;qr=directgoods_3965397276&amp;shopAutoEnter=1" data-url="https://shop18748095.m.youzan.com/wscgoods/detail/271j7jd1k5bifrs?scan=1&amp;activity=none&amp;from=kdt&amp;qr=directgoods_3965397276&amp;shopAutoEnter=1"><span>shop18748095.m.youzan.com</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>🍻延伸阅读《TOPYS专访库索：我在居酒屋发现，“酒是全人类的医生”》：</span><a href="https://www.topys.cn/article/31947" data-url="https://www.topys.cn/article/31947"><span>www.topys.cn</span></a></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmsRbwoirsTp2rwt0wG5DHKSsLkQ.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>｜About this episode｜</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾：库索</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播：鲸鱼</span></p><span></span><p><span>制作：鲸鱼</span></p><span></span><p><span>视觉设计：silin</span></p><span></span><p><span>音乐：坂東祐大; LEO今井; 鈴木大介; 佐藤采香; 大家一将 - 《Attachments》</span></p><span></span><p><span>公众号：顶尖文案TOPYS</span></p><span></span><p><span>特别鸣谢：北京贝贝特诸位同仁</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lr7G2pmdCiMjlzUEHTcck7Gc4f2m.m4a" length="109277498" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:15:20</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L2xwVlZRVld3R0ptUVd5YTNuMndDTGUxMjlweGQucG5n.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>从诞生到商业化，让我们来好好聊聊「播客」｜品牌月历</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66224c7c83d6d1c73863eb96</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66224c7c83d6d1c73863eb96</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 19 Apr 2024 15:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>你也许天天都听播客，但不知道你会不会好奇，这个内容形态为什么是今天这幅模样？是什么原因导致了播客时长巨长、用户粘性高但偏偏商业化难做？而看似佛系的播客背后，竟然也曾经有过豪掷千金的商业故事。</span></p><span></span><p><span>今天这期节目，就带你从头了解「播客」，从技术、从内容、从商业，好好唠唠。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>一段播客小史，送给爱听播客的你。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="67">01:07</a> 播客的兴起也许承接着时代的情绪</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="184">03:04</a> 播客的诞生，自带反骨</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="331">05:31</a> 技术赋予播客的三大特点</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="442">07:22</a> iPod和iPhone如何让播客变得自带陪伴感</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="619">10:19</a> 播客行业起飞，竟然源于一档罪案节目</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="811">13:31</a> 播客在美国做大做强的故事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="947">15:47</a> Spotify如何布局它的播客帝国</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1168">19:28</a> Spotify遭遇的商业化难题</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1437">23:57</a> 中文播客的元年与用户画像</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1678">27:58</a> 中文播客收听渠道与节目画像</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1815">30:15</a> 国内播客的商业化之路</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2097">34:57</a> 结语：反叛的播客</span></p><span></span><p><em><span>美国播客用户统计</span></em></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn."></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn."></p><span></span><p><em><span>JUSTPOD 2022中文播客调研报告</span></em></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn."></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn."></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn."></p><span></span><p><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/2VF58r9jdxBQ1t37AKFMkw" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/2VF58r9jdxBQ1t37AKFMkw"><span>如果你想阅读本期节目的图文版，欢迎点击此处，即可跳转阅读推文</span></a></p><span></span><p><em><span>主要参考文献：</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>JustPod《2022中文播客新观察》</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>Edison Research, The Podcast Consumer 2023</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>《2023小宇宙播客大赏：众声皆心声》</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>WSJ, Spotify’s $1 Billion Podcast Bet Turns Into a Serial Drama</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>澎湃新闻《如此城市·噶闹忙｜在播客之都，重估声音的价值》</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>36氪《36氪专访｜日谈公园创始人李志明：播客破圈是迟早的事》</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>数英DIGTALING《专访：播客界顶流JustPod，说自己是一家广告公司》</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>网易云x36氪《00后长音频消费趋势报告》</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>中国企业家杂志《7600万小时的小宇宙，中文播客要跨出窄众》</span></em></p><span></span><p><span>🎙️</span></p><span></span><p><span>｜About this episode｜</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期主播：罗兰</span></p><span></span><p><span>制作：罗兰</span></p><span></span><p><span>视觉设计：silin</span></p><span></span><p><span>音乐：《Sunflower》-Post Malone</span></p><span></span><p><span>｜About us｜</span></p><span></span><p><span>TOPYS编辑部，暂时将你的mind close起来</span></p><span></span><p><span>微信公众号：顶尖文案TOPYS</span></p>]]></description>
