  <item>
    <title>做了3天“创意特种兵”都学到了啥？｜串台【循环往复】</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/650284ea5c88d24126d8e38a</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">650284ea5c88d24126d8e38a</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 14 Sep 2023 03:58:34 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>MINDPARK2023刚结束不久，发起人老黄做客友台【循环往复】，来跟大家聊聊这场聚集了全球顶尖创意大脑的盛会，以及广告创意对我们普通人的生活可能会产生什么样的影响。</span></p><span></span><p><span>在这场为期3天的创意思维盛会中，以“多重视角，多维创新”为主题，以“先锋论坛、创意在发生、创意之夜、大师班、大师1V1、主题工作坊、创意城市、创意城市指南、品牌实验室”为互动内容，多形式、多角度去挖掘创意案例与观点，结合市场趋势与商业实践，引领嘉宾以全新视角思考现状，探索未来创意的商业价值。</span></p><span></span><p><span>邀请到了与电影《蜘蛛侠：纵横宇宙》合作的创意工作室、中国本土电影《中国奇谭》的总导演、来自瑞士的模块家居品牌USM的可持续发展总监以及设计界绝对的摇滚明星施德明等30位全球顶尖的创意人与商业领袖。</span></p><span></span><p><br><span></span><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="289">00:04:49</a> </span></strong><span>更综合的MINDPARK创意大会</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="407">00:06:47</a></span></strong><span>世界范围内有哪些不错的创意大会？</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="898">00:14:58</a> </span></strong><span>无可替代的现场体验</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1091">00:18:11</a> </span></strong><span>才艺换门票、大师课及创意工作坊的观众感受</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1321">00:22:01</a> </span></strong><span>中国的品牌市场愿意为看似小众的创意付费吗？</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1551">00:25:51</a></span></strong><span>“全球最差旅馆”创意案例</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1805">00:30:05</a> </span></strong><span>怎么看国内广告的过度包装和跟风打卡</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2039">00:33:59</a> </span></strong><span>创意的主体到底是人还是机器？</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2285">00:38:05</a> </span></strong><span>理想状态中MINDPARK可以成长为什么样子？</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2472">00:41:12</a> </span></strong><span>普通人可以通过什么方法激发自己的创意特质？</span></p><span></span><p><span>片头片尾音乐：Alchemist,Echo.K – D+K+脑波交流与阅读展览</span></p><span></span><p><span>节目策划、后期剪辑、图文排版：【循环往复】阿鲸</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/luYQcJAhz_y4zRKA9nzONX_JpjIn.m4a" length="63634653" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:43:50</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqjTuR05PBYgsBEFHyzqJSJW2qtY.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>用凝视打败凝视，这本女性主义小说有点酷｜Shall We Talk Vol.13</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/64b4af5f5680f4d4a8f64f7d</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">64b4af5f5680f4d4a8f64f7d</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 17 Jul 2023 03:02:53 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="204">3:24</a> 话题性女性主义小说的诞生记</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="406">6:46</a> 抓人眼球的书名，就它了！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="542">9:02</a> 书的外封和内封有点意思</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="770">12:50</a> 光是书名就已经冒犯到谁了我不说</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1008">16:48</a> 是名场面，也是真实鲜活的女性主义者现实</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1267">21:07</a> 承担阐释性劳动的往往是女性</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1385">23:05</a> 主动去凝视男权社会的种种厌女倾向</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1557">25:57</a> 现实性大于文学性，鼓励女性创作的意义</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1769">29:29</a> 女性主义者可以探讨异性恋亲密关系吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2225">37:05</a> 女性主义读物流行背后东亚社会的共通性</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2592">43:12</a> 作为编辑“开天眼”后的职场观察</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2880">48:00</a> 去影响文化消费，女性编辑和读者的胜利！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3100">51:40</a> 艺文行业中女性劳动者的生存现状</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3227">53:47</a> 阅读，大笑，然后思考</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmQ_RyWszz7faN_ouXHMvOqJa8fW.jpeg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvPIN0-Htww-3gtUBuR8dnACdQUx.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>🔗</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>直达专访：</span></strong><a href="https://www.topys.cn/article/33803" data-url="https://www.topys.cn/article/33803"><strong><span>作者闵智炯</span></strong></a></p><span></span><p><strong><span>购书任意门：</span></strong><a href="https://shop18748095.m.youzan.com/wscgoods/detail/2op4o024zqokn7s?scan=1&amp;activity=none&amp;from=kdt&amp;qr=directgoods_2552518080&amp;shopAutoEnter=1" data-url="https://shop18748095.m.youzan.com/wscgoods/detail/2op4o024zqokn7s?scan=1&amp;activity=none&amp;from=kdt&amp;qr=directgoods_2552518080&amp;shopAutoEnter=1"><strong><span>《她厌男，她是我女友》</span></strong></a></p><span></span><p><span>🎙️</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>｜About this episode｜</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>本期主播：鲸鱼</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾：磨铁文治图书编辑 胡马丽花</span></p><span></span><p><span>制作：鲸鱼</span></p><span></span><p><span>视觉设计：huimeng</span></p><span></span><p><span>片头片尾：徐佳莹-《不安小姐》</span></p>]]></description>
