  <item>
    <title>城南唠嗑Vol.16 编剧徐珺蕊：“我是想照亮舞台的那束光”</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/64a23b44233bfbafdf84e814</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">64a23b44233bfbafdf84e814</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 03 Jul 2023 03:06:42 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="199">3:19</a> 《大熊猫》、采风与破题的故事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="734">12:14</a> 挑战！舞剧编剧的叙事艺术</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1060">17:40</a> 如何找到“光”？《咏春》的“迷你研讨会”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1552">25:52</a> 让文字转化为“肢体语汇”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1699">28:19</a>《只此青绿》的诞生是一种“文化自觉”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1985">33:05</a> 如何成为舞剧编剧？谁知道呢</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2300">38:20</a> 青绿里“出现了一个现代人”是怎么回事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2710">45:10</a> 导演和编剧的“相爱相杀”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2710">45:10</a> “我就是那束光，照亮舞台的那束”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2827">47:07</a> “弱小可怜又无助”的创作初体验</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3290">54:50</a> 语文老师的宠儿（放养版）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3608">1:00:08</a> “我的作品从来没有属于过我”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4034">1:07:14</a> 沉迷工作无法自拔是什么体验</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4178">1:09:38</a> 一切创作的核心是什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4562">1:16:02</a> 如果可以穿越，最想见证哪一时刻</span></p><span></span><p><span>节目完成文本看这里👉<a data-url="https://www.topys.cn/article/33810" href="https://www.topys.cn/article/33810">www.topys.cn</a></span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lqkzlusFBTmMyJJd9HGGeNZ4zsRh.m4a" length="76023640" type="audio/mp4"/>
